		"description": "<p><strong>Suffering Rite — Corrupt.</strong> 1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target: the enemy is Impaired, 2 turns (you choose the condition). While Impaired this way, it loses any resistances. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using this Rite checks the target for your Soul Touched and removes it (the module warns but lets you proceed if the target isn’t marked).</em></p><p><em>[M] Apply your chosen Impaired condition for 2 turns and ignore the target’s resistances by hand.</em></p>",
